GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-oauth-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
JWT_SECRET=use-a-long-random-string-at-least-32-chars

# Google Cloud Console (APIs & Services > Credentials):
# - Use OAuth client type: Web application
# - This app uses Google Identity Services (Sign-In button) + JWT to your API.
#   Set Authorized JavaScript origins: http://localhost:5173 and your prod URL (scheme+host+port, no path).
# - If Google shows redirect_uri mismatch, add Authorized redirect URIs with the SAME origins (e.g. http://localhost:5173).
# For a pure server redirect flow instead, add e.g. https://your-domain.com/api/auth/google/callback and implement that route.
